# Essence Scatter counters target creature spell. Bot1 holds up an Island and Mox Sapphire with two Scatters. Bot2's Llanowar
# Elves is a creature spell: Bot1 counters it (it goes to Bot2's graveyard, never onto the battlefield). Two turns later Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt aimed at Bot1 is not a creature spell, so Essence Scatter is not offered against it (the refusal, with the
# same mana and the second Scatter in hand) and the Bolt resolves: Bot1 is at 17.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Essence Scatter
Essence Scatter
Island x3
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Forest x14

